    "description": {
      "content": "The Dynatrace Account Management API allows you to manage your Dynatrace account including users, groups, permissions, and environments. It uses OAuth 2.0 authentication with account-level scopes. The API enables programmatic management of identity and access controls, including creating users, assigning users to groups, defining group permissions, and listing environments associated with the account. This is the primary API for automating IAM workflows in Dynatrace.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dynatrace Support",
